WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:07.170
What will be the effect of the Trump coup
riot on the future of the Republican Party?

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:11.640
And many of you asking me is at the end of
the Republican Party, this is not the end

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.450
of the Republican Party, the Republican Party.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:18.160
And by that I mean the Republicans that remain
in the public eye.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:22.480
They say that they are not people of substance.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:29.359
OK, Lindsey Graham denounced Trump ism early
in the 2016 Republican primary and then he

00:00:29.359 --> 00:00:33.969
embraced it and then he partially called out
some of the things Trump did.

00:00:33.969 --> 00:00:37.210
But then he golfs with Trump and Brown noses
him all the time.

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:42.729
And just in these last two weeks before Trump
leaves, Lindsey Graham gave a sensible speech

00:00:42.729 --> 00:00:48.350
on the floor of the House during that joint
session in counting the ballots, saying this

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:49.350
has to stop.

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:50.350
Joe Biden is president.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:51.500
Ba ba ba ba ba.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:56.570
And then within 48 hours was on Fox News pleading
mercy for Trump, who did the right thing and

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:58.190
shouldn't be impeached a second time.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.370
So these people are of no substance.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:01.519
These are weasels.

00:01:01.519 --> 00:01:04.470
OK, Susan Collins, in a less cartoonish way.

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:09.190
How many times, as she said, well, I'm disappointed
in the president.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:15.640
I'm very concerned with the president, and
then she never once votes to make anything

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:16.640
change.

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:22.360
So I expect that the Republican officials
that survive this, some simply won't.

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:26.770
The Republican officials that survive this
are going to weasel their way out with some

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:31.010
of the both side stuff combined with I did
denounce this one thing.

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:34.060
At this point, they're going to pay lip service
as necessary.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:36.130
There's not going to be any real introspection.

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:38.270
It will be just attacks on Democrats and liberals.

00:01:38.270 --> 00:01:41.060
And, you know, we're against violence type
of thing.

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:45.480
So the future of the Republican Party is going
to be determined not by the Republican elected.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:47.320
We know what they're going to do.

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:49.380
It's going to depend on Republican voters.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:55.190
Now, when I say that many of you will not
be optimistic and I understand why any party

00:01:55.190 --> 00:02:01.430
whose electorate can be bamboozled into choosing
Trump in a primary and then voting for him

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:06.950
60 million, 60 something million people in
2016 and then 70 something million voting

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:09.129
for him in 2020 after everything we saw.

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:12.910
Yeah, I don't have high expectations for those
people either.

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:23.450
But but there is a degree of this was too
much that we are seeing among some Republicans.

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:29.090
I'm not talking the Cunanan insurrectionists
that still to this day are saying Antifa did

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:30.400
the riot.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.519
I'm not talking about them.

00:02:31.519 --> 00:02:33.450
They're probably beyond help.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:41.120
But I am talking about people who would be
more in line with John McCain or Mitt Romney

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:46.819
or, you know, even somebody like William Weld,
the former Republican governor of Massachusetts,

00:02:46.819 --> 00:02:47.879
to go back a little bit.

00:02:47.879 --> 00:02:55.999
A lot of those folks see the difference between
what they believe and what Donald Trump brought

00:02:55.999 --> 00:02:57.749
to the Republican Party.

00:02:57.749 --> 00:03:03.109
And while I don't expect them to be political
allies in any real, substantive way on policy,

00:03:03.109 --> 00:03:11.909
they may require some kind of bigger change
within the party, the Republican Party, that

00:03:11.909 --> 00:03:15.389
would prevent another Trump from happening
again.

00:03:15.389 --> 00:03:17.239
I'm not super optimistic.

00:03:17.239 --> 00:03:19.260
I'm trying to give you the best case scenario.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:25.950
And I. I think it's simply too early to know
it's you know, you don't know to say what's

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:31.909
the damage when when the hurricane is still
happening is difficult to say, you know, but

00:03:31.909 --> 00:03:37.340
if on if on September 12th, we had said, what
is the full political impact of 9/11, it would

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:38.489
have been too early by that.

00:03:38.489 --> 00:03:40.090
We didn't know yet.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:43.409
Some of us you know, we may be suspected that
a war was coming, but we didn't know that

00:03:43.409 --> 00:03:48.620
the U.S. would go to war with the wrong country
on September 12th, that it was too early.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.799
So to some degree, it's just too early.

00:03:50.799 --> 00:03:55.829
But I'm giving you some sense of what the
best case scenario might be.

00:03:55.829 --> 00:04:01.739
We will be here with you next week for the
inauguration and swearing in of Joe Biden,

00:04:01.739 --> 00:04:03.499
hopefully not for any violence.

00:04:03.499 --> 00:04:05.439
I hope there isn't any.

00:04:05.439 --> 00:04:09.199
We are off on Monday, Martin Luther King Day,
no show Monday.

00:04:09.199 --> 00:04:14.590
Martin Luther King Day will be back with you
Tuesday and then Wednesday, live for the inauguration

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:15.590
as well.

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:17.700
I'll see everybody then enjoy the bonus show.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:05:17.530
